# Two-tier data:
#   Overview (web/data/meta.json + glitches.bin) IS committed so the site works.
#   Detail tier is served from a GitHub Release (or copied locally for testing) —
#   never commit it.
web/data/conf.bin
web/data/ids.txt
web/data/uuids.bin

